DESCRIPTION:Join Pisgah Area SORBA for a Trail Work Day! Meeting location 
 and trail will be shared as the date approaches Come lend a hand as we wor
 k together to maintain and improve the trails we all love. No experience i
 s necessary—our crew leaders will provide tools\, guidance\, and instruc
 tion. What to Bring: Required: Long pants\, boots that cover your ankles\,
  safety glasses\, gloves\, hardhat (bike helmets DO NOT count\, but climbi
 ng helmets do)\, snacks/lunch and water. Note: Hardhats\, gloves and safet
 y glasses can be provided if needed. All tools will be provided\n\nMore: h
 ttps://www.pisgahareasorba.org/\n\nSource: Pisgah Area SORBA\n\nListed by 
 Altar Cycles — altar.bike/calendar
